# The Sackville-Bagginses: "When The Sackville-Bagginses enter, you may sacrifice another creature or artifact. If you do, draw a
# card and create a Treasure token." On turn 3 Bot1 taps its Llanowar Elves for mana, casts the Sackville-Bagginses with it and a
# Swamp, and sacrifices the Elves (a nontoken creature: no life is lost, "Whenever you sacrifice a TOKEN"). It draws a card and
# gets a Treasure. Sacrificing that Treasure token for mana (a cost sacrifice, CR 701.21a) triggers the second ability:
# Bot2 loses 1 life.

